1385380/extras/2e4aa64eb8dd3f101ffe3a49587f5a26.mp4?t=1790078458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385380/extras/415ad996b039b69ee8cae892bfd0c915.webp?t=1790078458\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>定期更新和内容推出会让您一次次回归瑟能西亚。<br></li><li>想要对抗其他玩家来考验自己吗？那就进行每周挑战模式吧。牌组和地图是预先设定；能否成功就取决于您的技巧。<br></li><li>归功于跨平台游玩功能，可以与其他平台的玩家组队。<br></li><li>当您拥有剧情可下载内容时，与整个队伍中的各平台玩家分享，让朋友们跟随您一同冒险。<br></li><li>“再玩一场吧。”享受无与伦比的多样性和无穷无尽的耐玩度，《横跨方尖碑》激发您的实验精神，让您欲罢不能！</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385380/extras/c25edaa55dcefef92537d099ad95338e.poster.avif?t=1790078458\" width=620 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385380/extras/c25edaa55dcefef92537d099ad95338e.webm?t=1790078458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385380/extras/c25edaa55dcefef92537d099ad95338e.mp4?t=1790078458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "在多人合作的 Roguelite 牌组构筑游戏中启程，每个选择在此都很重要！打造出力量惊人的牌组。可独自一人或与最多三名朋友踏上旅程。在《横跨方尖碑》中规划队伍走向荣耀之路，展开深奥的策略战斗，对抗强大的敌人，接受使命，拯救瑟能西亚王国！", "supported_languages": "英语, 简体中文, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 日语, 韩语, 繁体中文, 法语, 德语", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385380/header.jpg?t=1790078458", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385380/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1790078458", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385380/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1790078458", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></l